ntent":"@deansmith729 Yeah but I don\u2019t think Shannon wants to open up a discussion on his old allegations. There was no Twitter then but they could revamp it for the #MeToo era. Also don\u2019t kick a man when he\u2019s down. AB obviously is having a mental health crisis.","userId":265523983,"media":null,"username":"Big6domino","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":185,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":9,"sumOfMeToo":17,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":1.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1176962100717064192","date":1569444606000,"rawContent":"#AmberGuyger is blonde &amp; a cop. Unfortunately for her victim\u2019s family I believe this combination is unable to be prosecuted in America. There have been too many loopholes created to avoid ever imprisoning a blonde cop. I can\u2019t see it. #BlackLivesMatter","userId":265523983,"media":null,"username":"Big6domino","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":186,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":9,"sumOfMeToo":17,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":2.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":1.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1176963935825747968","date":1569445043000,"rawContent":"When #AmberGuyger called dispatch after killing her neighbor 10 police officers were sent within two minutes to be by her side. That\u2019s 10 more people than #BothamJean had to lean on in his dying moments when Amber Guyger was busy texting her Boo. #BlackLivesMatter","userId":265523983,"media":null,"username":"Big6domino","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":187,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":9,"sumOfMeT